%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI appreciate your concern, but...\d%K%P
「你能这么为我着想，我很高兴，可是…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dY-You're right! What the hell am I even saying?\nI'm sorry, Osamu. You can forget all about this\nsilliness.\d%K%P
「果、果然是这样！\n我在说些什么呢，真是个失礼的女人！\n对不起啊理，别在意这些，忘了它好么？」%K%P
But...%K%P
可是…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI don't think it was silly. Thank you for inviting me. It\nmade me happy, and I'm not just saying that.\d%K%P
「你可别那么想啊。\n谢谢你的邀请。\n我真的很高兴」%K%P
I had turned into a man who could turn down the Asami from\nfive years ago with words alone.%K%P
面对五年前的麻实，\n我却变成了用社交辞令来应付的人。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dNo, I'm sorry. I really am. I know it's painful for you\nto even have me standing in front you.\d%K%P
「不不，对不起啊，真的很抱歉。\n明明我哪怕只是站在你面前，\n对你来说就是一种痛苦的…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYou don't need to apologize that many times.\nAnd I don't think that way.\d%K%P
「别一个劲地道歉啊…\n我没那么想」%K%P
If I did, I wouldn't be meeting her every week... Nor\nwould I be drinking or having dinners with her.%K%P
我要是那样想的话就不会跟你保持联系。\n不会几乎每个星期都去见你。刚才也不会和你一起喝酒了。%K%P
...I wouldn't be smiling in her presence.%K%P
…更不会对你展现出笑容了。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dYou kept meeting me and even treated me like you did back\nin those days, so I got this crazy idea in my head that we\nmade up.\d%K%P
「因为你平常总是很自然地跟我见面…\n对待我也像过去一样那么温柔…\n我以为就这样能跟你重新和好」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWe did make up. There's no bad blood between us.\d%K%P
「已经和好了啊。\n在我们之间，已经没有什么芥蒂了」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...Really?\d%K%P
「…真的？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYes.\d%K%P
「那还用说」%K%P
So this was my fault.%K%P
所以，这个只是我单方面的原因。%K%P
My fault for feeling an odd shiver during the meaningless\nsmall talk we'd just had.%K%P
这是对刚才我们漫不经心的对话、\n我不知为何感到有点恶寒的原因。%K%P
It was my fault for wanting desperately to confirm whether\nor not my own happiness still aligned with Toko's.%K%P
这是无论如何都想确认我的幸福和都子的幸福、\n其未来指向是否相同的，我的原因。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dGoodnight.\nBe careful with the oil heater. The air is very dry these\ndays.\d%K%P
「晚安。\n注意防火啊。\n最近天干物燥」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dAh, yeah... goodnight.\d%K%P
「啊，嗯…晚安」%K%P
After using a vapid disaster prevention line to lighten\nthe mood, I turned my back to her.%K%P
我故意用防火的提醒把喝茶这事糊弄过去后，\n马上转身背向她。%K%P
After all, there was no bad blood between us.%K%P
因为，我们之间，已经没有芥蒂了啊。%K%P
Our relationship was perfectly healthy, much like it was\neight years ago when we were a senior and an underclassman\nat a club.%K%P
就好像八年前初次见面的时候一样，\n两人的关系是无比正确的前辈与后辈的关系。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
%XS10\dThen... why didn't you come in?\d %XE%K%P
「既然如此…为什么你不上来啊」%K%P
